{title: I Will Sing of My Redeemer}
{artist: Philip Bliss & James McGranahan}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 92}

Verse 1
[G]I will sing of my Re[C]deemer [G]and his wondrous [D]love to me:
[G]on the cruel cross he [C]suffered, [G]from the curse to [D]set me [G]free.

Chorus
[G]Sing, O sing of my Re[C]deemer! With his [G]blood he purchased [A]me;
[D]on the [G]cross he sealed my [C]pardon, [G]paid the debt, and [D]made me [G]free.
